                                                "sense_id": "19a2b98c-6944-3e3f-81bf-f3f5f0885117",
                                                "text": "In a moment Tom was angry. The women saw that Bill had touched him upon the raw, and they went out of the room to prepare a meal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
